  "notes": "Yusuf: no plate; geometric only on «معاذ الله». 79:1-10 keeps «إلا من وجدنا متاعنا عنده» whole in one chip. STAGING v4: In the town, as in 74-77: the brothers (a plain group of three in dark robes) with their camel, and Yusuf only as a blue drop labelled Yusuf at the right. c1 (78): the brothers plead with him (78:1, 78:9, 78:12); they do not bow (no figure lowers itself before Yusuf's drop); Binyamin and their father are not drawn. c2 (79): Yusuf answers (79:1), a geometric plate for I seek refuge in Allah (79:2-3), he shakes his drop in refusal as he says he will take only the one with whom the measure was found (79:5) and speaks again (79:11). The camera stays wide (no pans or close-ups that crop the label)."
